        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Transfer to the international airport for your flight to San José. An English-speaking guide meets you on arrival.\n\nFrom there, your driver takes you to La Fortuna and the northern foothills of Arenal Volcano, where you can relax in the hot springs.\n\nOvernight at Arenal Kioro Suites & Spa in a Standard double room with breakfast included. Meals: breakfast."
    },
    {
