        "runId": "ada-en-14e358aa-5c7e-4f7d-99e1-c711351eb01b",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Arenal to Caño Negro Wildlife Refuge"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:fb5db666cae6efb7",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "2ff2500a889e1f94d296296f43127e65e1cf35ad2a9c7af4aaaa47e862b1aca1",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-14e358aa-5c7e-4f7d-99e1-c711351eb01b",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Meet at 08:00 for the trip with an English-speaking group. The transfer takes about two hours.\n\nAfter breakfast, the roughly three-hour tour of Caño Negro begins. The refuge is known for its variety of birds, tropical plants and wildlife, including sloths, monkeys, caimans and basilisk lizards.\n\nDrinks are offered on arrival before you board a comfortable boat for a cruise through the refuge. Watch for wildlife and see the local plants along the way. Lunch is provided after the tour.\n\nOvernight at Arenal Kioro Suites & Spa in a Standard double room with breakfast included. Meals: breakfast and lunch."
    },
    {
